    "annotations": [
        {
            "id": "ann_1",
            "type": "note",
            "text": "VOL Fluid Simulation — Navier-Stokes Density Advection\n\nFluidVOL runs a 4-pass GPU fluid solver each frame:\n  1. Inject density from upstream noise source\n  2. Advect density by velocity field\n  3. Compute divergence + Jacobi pressure solve\n  4. Project velocity (subtract pressure gradient)\n\nDissipation=0.97 gives slow density decay (smoke-like).\nPulse Reset to clear the simulation.\nLower resolution (48³) for interactive frame rates.",
